id=MirageVerboseBoot
name=Mirage Verbose Boot + Anti-Bootloop
version=v1.1.3
versionCode=5
author=Mor4land
description=Arch Linux style real-time kernel (/dev/kmsg) + Android init + system boot logger via SurfaceFlinger BLAST overlay. Auto-detects genuine bootloops, disables all Magisk modules (including itself), and saves full crash logs to /sdcard/Download/MirageBootloop_LAST.log.
